# Flames for the Dead (battlefield.flames_for_the_dead#helper): a party of five, all in Bearclaw Pinnacle. Main at Ulmia
# 8 enters option 1. Bob (9, a helper) enters too. Cat (7) is refused with no menu (an event release with mode 0, no
# message): her update and finish send nothing. Dan (Three Paths completed, For Whom the Verse is Sung current) enters.
# Eve (The Road Forks current) is refused. The Snoll Tzar killed, five ticks: the win event 32001 goes to main, bob and
# dan; each finishes: 1000 XP and title 364 for all three; Three Paths' Bearclaw Pinnacle 32001 moves only main's Ulmia
# field, 8 to 9.
lists BearclawPinnacle/Wind_Pillar_1/onTrigger BearclawPinnacle/onEventUpdate/32000 BearclawPinnacle/onEventFinish/32000 BearclawPinnacle/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=BearclawPinnacle pos=-720,9,-441 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
char bob zone=BearclawPinnacle pos=-720,9,-441 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
char cat zone=BearclawPinnacle pos=-720,9,-441 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
char dan zone=BearclawPinnacle pos=-720,9,-441 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
char eve zone=BearclawPinnacle pos=-720,9,-441 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Cop ThreePaths current
bob: mission Cop ThreePaths current
cat: mission Cop ThreePaths current
dan: mission Cop ForWhomTheVerseIsSung current
eve: mission Cop TheRoadForks current
login
bob: login
invite bob
bob: accept
cat: login
invite cat
cat: accept
dan: login
invite dan
dan: accept
eve: login
invite eve
eve: accept
missionstatus Cop 8 pos=4               # a GM
bob: missionstatus Cop 9 pos=4          # a GM
cat: missionstatus Cop 7 pos=4          # a GM
trigger Wind_Pillar_1
update 32000 option=1
finish
bob: trigger Wind_Pillar_1
bob: update 32000 option=1
bob: finish
cat: trigger Wind_Pillar_1
cat: update 32000 option=1
cat: finish
dan: trigger Wind_Pillar_1
dan: update 32000 option=1
dan: finish
eve: trigger Wind_Pillar_1
eve: update 32000 option=1
eve: finish
tick 2000
kill SNOLL_TZAR_OFFSET
tick 2000
tick 2000
tick 2000
tick 2000
tick 2000
finish
bob: finish
cat: finish
dan: finish
eve: finish
tick 11000
